---
import { Clock, MapPin } from "lucide-react";
import ActionLink from "./ActionLink";
---

<main class="bg-background py-14 text-foreground sm:py-20 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto w-[calc(100%-2rem)] max-w-7xl sm:w-[calc(100%-3rem)]">
        <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
            <div class="min-w-0 space-y-8">
                <div>
                    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl leading-tight font-medium sm:text-4xl">Estamos en el corazón de Atlatlahucan</h1>
                    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Ubicados en una zona privilegiada de Morelos, ofrecemos un espacio único rodeado de naturaleza y el clima perfecto para tu evento.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-6">
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="shrink-0 rounded-md border border-border bg-accent p-3"><MapPin className="size-6 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true" /></div>
                        <div class="min-w-0">
                            <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Jardín de Eventos SKY</h2>
                            <p class="mt-1 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Carr. Federal México-Cuautla, Atlatlahucan, Morelos</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="shrink-0 rounded-md border border-border bg-accent p-3"><Clock className="size-6 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true" /></div>
                        <div class="min-w-0">
                            <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Horario de visitas</h2>
                            <p class="mt-1 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Lunes a Sábado: 9:00 AM - 6:00 PM<br />(Previa cita)</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <ActionLink href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Jardin+de+Eventos+SKY/@18.9352747,-98.9033845,17z" label="Cómo llegar" external />
            </div>
            <div class="relative aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border lg:aspect-auto lg:h-150">
                <iframe src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Jardin%20de%20Eventos%20SKY%20Atlatlahucan%20Morelos&t=&z=17&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed" title="Mapa de Jardín de Eventos SKY en Atlatlahucan, Morelos" class="absolute inset-0 size-full border-0" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>
